  "solution": "**Given : **\n\n**18 + (12 × 6) + (63 ÷ 7) × 4 +{(27)⁽¹⁾/⁽³⁾}-11=112\\:**\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nBy option Method:\n\n**Option 1 : exchange 18, 11**\n\n⇒ 11 + (12 × 6) + (63 ÷ 7) × 4 +{(27)⁽¹⁾/⁽³⁾}-18=112\\:\n\n⇒11 + 72 + 9 x 4 + 3 - 18 = 112\n\n⇒ 11 + 72 + 36 +3 -18 = 112\n\n⇒ 104 ≠ 112\n\nThis is not correct the equation.\n\n**Option 2 : exchange 12, 4**\n\n⇒ 18 + (4 × 6) + (63 ÷ 7) × 12 +{(27)⁽¹⁾/⁽³⁾}-11=112\\:\n\n⇒ 18 + 24 + 9 x 12 + 3 -11 = 112\n\n⇒ 18 + 24 + 108 + 3 -11 = 112\n\n⇒ 142 ≠ 112\n\nThis is not correct the equation.\n\n**Option 3: exchange 6, 4**\n\n⇒ 18 + (12 × 4) + (63 ÷ 7) × 6 +{(27)⁽¹⁾/⁽³⁾}-11=112\\:\n\n⇒ 18 + 48 + 9 x 6 + 3 -11 = 112\n\n⇒ 18 + 48 + 54 + 3 -11 = 112\n\n⇒ 112 = 112\n\nThis is correct the equation.\n\n**Option 4: exchange 18, 12**\n\n⇒ 12 + (18 × 6) + (63 ÷ 7) × 4 +{(27)⁽¹⁾/⁽³⁾}-11=112\\:\n\n⇒ 12 + 108 + 9 x 4 +3 -11 =112\n\n⇒ 12 + 108 + 36 +3 -11 =112\n\n⇒ 148 ≠ 112\n\nThis is not correct the equation.\n\nHence, **'Option 3'** is the correct answer.\n\n3d:T198f,\n<",
